cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this toolkit, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Fragility Metrics Toolkit"
abstract: >-
  Open-source implementation of the p-fr-nb framework for complete
  statistical evidence assessment. Every statistical result is reported
  with three measurements: p (statistical significance), fr (fragility:
  how stable that significance is) and nb (robustness: how far the result
  is from neutrality). Includes Python notebook calculators for binary
  2x2 tables, matched 2x2 tables, diagnostic metrics, proportion versus
  benchmark, correlation and continuous outcomes.
